otations visually on a map view. Annotation image objects wrap "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIImage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects and may be recycled later and put into a reuse queue that is maintained"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the map view."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationimage"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNCoordinateQuad":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncoordinatequad","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNCoordinateQuad"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A quadrilateral area as measured on a two-dimensional map projection."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCoordinateQuad","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" differs from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCoordinateQuad","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in that it allows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representation of non-axis aligned bounds and non-rectangular quadrilaterals."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The coordinates are described in counter clockwise order from top left."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNCoordinateQuad","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCoordinateQuad"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNImageSource/coordinates":{"title":"coordinates","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNImageSource\/coordinate